  "description": "A comprehensive .NET 9 library for astronomical calculations. Includes solar/lunar/planetary positions, coordinate transforms, rise/transit/set times, eclipse detection, telescope optics, Messier & star catalogs, meteor showers, double stars, lunar features, constellation identification, and observing session planners. Based on Meeus \"Astronomical Formulae for Calculators\" and USNO algorithms.",
